<title>USA: Accumed stake held by Kingdon group.</title>
<headline>Accumed stake held by Kingdon group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Kingdon Capital Management Corp said Tuesday it holds a 5.21 percent stake or 1,143,000 common shares in AccuMed International Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York-based investment adviser said it paid $3.998 million for the stake and holds it for investment.</p>
<p>Kingdon said its stake includes 190,000 shares it bought on October 3 for $4.50 a share.</p>
<p>AccuMed, based in Chicago, makes laboratory diagnostic products.</p>
</text>
